{
    "_comment": "The overheard Wren x Milo argument at the way up to the Core. Only if you gave Wren the tape, and only after the Garden boss (story/wren.py). Starts by itself when you come close; the player only listens. Wren leaves for good, Milo stays - and the same talk goes straight on with his Core warning (milo_core_entrance). The point: the Core on its own is NOT the answer (the normal ending only quiets things down for a while).",
    "switch_partner": true,
    "partner": "wren",
    "start": [
        "argue"
    ],
    "nodes": {
        "argue": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "wren:argued"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_01",
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "angry",
                    "text": "-no, Milo, listen to me. Listen! The tape. 'We need to turn it off.' Someone built all of this. Someone can stop it."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_02",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Nobody can stop it, Wren."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_03",
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "angry",
                    "text": "You don't know that."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_04",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "I know more than you think."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_05",
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "angry",
                    "text": "Then tell me! For once, just tell me something true."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_06",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "...The Core isn't the answer."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_07",
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "It's the only way up. Everything leads there. The stones, the playground, the voice on the tape - it all points up."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_08",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "It points up because that's where people look."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_09",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "They go up. They break things. And for a while, everything is quiet."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_10",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "And then it starts again."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_11",
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "surprised",
                    "text": "Starts again? What starts again?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_12",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Everything."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_13",
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "angry",
                    "text": "That doesn't make any sense."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_14",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "I know. That's the worst part."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_15",
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "angry",
                    "text": "So what - we just sit here? Let the monsters get stranger every year? Let someone keep hiding things down here?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_16",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "I didn't say that."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_17",
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "angry",
                    "text": "You didn't say anything! You never do. You just stand there, one step ahead of everyone, smiling."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_core_entrance_08",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_18",
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "If the Core isn't the answer, then what is?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_19",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Something nobody has found yet."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_20",
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Then I'll find it."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_21",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "worried",
                    "text": "Wren-"
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_22",
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "No. I'm done with riddles. I'll find out myself. Up there, down there, wherever it is."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_23",
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "Goodbye, Milo."
                },
                {
                    "who": "look",
                    "pose": "empty",
                    "text": "Wren walks away without looking back."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_core_entrance_08",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "wren_argument_24",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "She'll be back. Everybody comes back."
                }
            ],
            "then": "dialogue:milo_core_entrance"
        }
    }
}
